---
import { getPath } from '../utils/navigation';
const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="py-16 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-4 text-primary animate-fadeIn">Što Kažu Naši Klijenti</h2>
    <p class="text-center text-gray-600 mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto animate-slideUp" style="animation-delay: 0.1s">Hiljadu zadovoljnih klijenta koji su imali odličan doživljaj sa našim servisom.</p>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl transition duration-300 transform hover:scale-105 animate-slideUp" style="animation-delay: 0.2s">
        <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-400 to-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-lg group-hover:animate-float">MJ</div>
          <div class="ml-4">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-primary">Marko Jovanović</h4>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Privatni vozač</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex mb-4">
          <span class="material-icons text-sm text-accent">star</span>
          <span class="material-icons text-sm text-accent">star</span>
          <span class="material-icons text-sm text-accent">star</span>
          <span class="material-icons text-sm text-accent">star</span>
          <span class="material-icons text-sm text-accent">star</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-600">Izuzetno brz i profesionalan servis. Sve je bilo gotovo u manje od sat vremena. Preporučujem svima!</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl transition duration-300 transform hover:scale-105 animate-slideUp" style="animation-delay: 0.3s">
        <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-400 to-orange-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-lg group-hover:animate-float">NK</div>
          <div class="ml-4">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-primary">Nikola Kostić</h4>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Vlasnik kompanije</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex mb-4">
          <span class="material-icons text-sm text-accent">star</span>
          <span class="material-icons text-sm text-accent">star</span>
          <span class="material-icons text-sm text-accent">star</span>
          <span class="material-icons text-sm text-accent">star</span>
          <span class="material-icons text-sm text-accent">star</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-600">Pouzdane ljude kojima se mogu poveriti sa mojim vozilima.透明cene bez pretnje. Odličan izbor!</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl transition duration-300 transform hover:scale-105 animate-slideUp" style="animation-delay: 0.4s">
        <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-green-400 to-green-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-lg group-hover:animate-float">AP</div>
          <div class="ml-4">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-primary">Ana Petrović</h4>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Penzionisana</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex mb-4">
          <span class="material-icons text-sm text-accent">star</span>
          <span class="material-icons text-sm text-accent">star</span>
          <span class="material-icons text-sm text-accent">star</span>
          <span class="material-icons text-sm text-accent">star</span>
          <span class="material-icons text-sm text-accent">star</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-600">Veoma ljubazna ekipa koja je pažljivo objasnila sve rezultate pregleda. Hvala vam puno!</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center mt-12">
      <a href={getPath('/kontakt', baseUrl)} class="inline-block bg-gradient-to-r from-accent to-orange-500 hover:from-orange-600 hover:to-red-500 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg transition transform hover:scale-105">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="material-icons">bolt</span>
          Zakaži Pregled Danas
        </span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
